));gap:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Washington County, UT Property Tax Guide: Offices, Appeals and Selling With Tax Due</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Utah</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Washington County, UT Property Tax Guide: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Washington County, UT Property Tax Guide sale</li><li>Turn the Washington County, UT Property Tax Guide offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling in Washington County? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy Washington County houses as-is and reply with a written cash offer.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Washington County, Utah property tax involves the county assessment office and the county treasurer.</strong></p><h2>Who to contact in Washington County</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.washco.utah.gov/departments/treasurer/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Washington County Treasurer</a></li><li><a href='https://www.washco.utah.gov/departments/assessor/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Washington County Assessor</a> handles assessment and appeals.</li></ul><h2>What we confirmed on official pages</h2><ul><li>Mail payments must be postmarked by November 30 to avoid penalties (unless the 30th falls on a weekend); check, cashier&#x27;s check or money order accepted by mail</li><li>In person: cash, check, cashier&#x27;s check or money order</li><li>Online eCheck via third party Instant Payments, $0.49 convenience fee per transaction; credit card (Visa, Discover, Mastercard) 2.5% fee or $1.50 minimum</li><li>Tax notice search available via outpost.washco.utah.gov (county-hosted)</li></ul><h2>Tax rate</h2><p> Utah bills combine county, municipal and school district levies.</p><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Washington County?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Washington County houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><h2>Washington County by the numbers</h2><p>Washington County has about 189,827 residents and 78,993 housing units in the Census Bureau's 2019-2023 survey, number 5 by population among the 10 Utah counties we cover. The median owner-occupied home is worth $465,600, 8% above the median of the Utah counties covered. Median household income is $76,411, against $90,870 for the middle Utah county. Owners live in 73% of occupied homes and renters in 27%. The median home was built in 2002, about 21 years ago.</p><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/utah-property-tax-guide/'>Utah Property Tax Guide: Appeals</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/utah-homestead-exemption/'>Utah Homestead Exemption Guide</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/utah-estate-tax/'>Utah Estate and Inheritance Tax</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-utah/'>We buy houses in Utah</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.washco.utah.gov/departments/treasurer/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Washington County Treasurer</a></li><li><a href='https://tax.utah.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Utah State Tax Commission</a></li><li><a href='https://le.utah.gov/xcode/code.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Utah Code</a></li></ul><p><em>This is general information about Washington County, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{