.gov/departments/administration/treasurer/index.php' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Tooele County Treasurer</a></li><li><a href='https://www.tooeleco.gov/departments/administration/assessor/real_property/index.php' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Tooele County Assessor</a> handles assessment and appeals.</li></ul><h2>Tax rate</h2><p> Utah bills combine county, municipal and school district levies.</p><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Tooele County?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Tooele County houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><h2>What we could not confirm</h2><ul><li>Official domain appears to be tooeleco.gov (also tooeleco.org vendor/eagle pages seen)</li></ul><h2>Tooele County by the numbers</h2><p>The Census Bureau's 2019-2023 survey counts 76,648 people and 24,138 housing units in Tooele County, which ranks 7 of 10 Utah counties here. Median home value is $391,300, which is 9% below the middle county in this Utah set. Households here earn a median $101,846; the middle Utah county is at $90,870. 17% of occupied homes are rented, which leaves 83% owner-occupied.</p><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-rela